{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "CoinBlock Clicker",
    "steam_appid": 2101730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/18e0c3002dba2e9fe19cda827a33d49f.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>Do you like spending hours watching numbers grow bigger and bigger?<br>Or maybe you like games where you can just sit back, relax and let the game play itself for some time.<br>Well, CoinBlock Clicker is possibly the perfect game for you! <br>With many hours of content and dozens of features to enhance your clicking  experience, you will never get bored.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/a7027fee08631331a21db4e099bb4f72.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>The idle implementation of CoinBlock Clicker is unlike any other. Purchase many different idle games and let them collect coins for you.<br>Your idle coins will be delivered to your doorstep through our special tube network.<br>By upgrading the tubes, you can increase your idle income even further!<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/3800967dc626fad198cab77862547c5c.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>For completing simple tasks, you can get rewards and collect in game currencies.<br>There is even a daily quest that resets every 24 hours and is worth much more than those normal quests.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/4b495e6dee4a74f0fee5972a0c46e22a.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>Become stronger and more powerful by unlocking the items in the special item shop.<br>Items are very important when you want to make those numbers grow rapidly. <br>Collecting items will trigger a small event that boosts your income for a short time or even clicks for you!<br>But the best part is that you can even upgrade your items! That will increase their strength even further.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/a55ee5ddd68d7d921bb7fd795230ee7f.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>After progressing to a specific point, you will notice that you can unlock a prestige world. <br>By doing so, you will prestige your current progress, and you will have to start all over again with nothing.<br>But it's worth it, all coins have an increased value that grows with each unlocked prestige world. <br>You also unlock new coins, minigames and tubes after each prestige. <br>That means for every prestige you unlock, there is more content for you to explore!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/18e0c3002dba2e9fe19cda827a33d49f.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>Do you like spending hours watching numbers grow bigger and bigger?<br>Or maybe you like games where you can just sit back, relax and let the game play itself for some time.<br>Well, CoinBlock Clicker is possibly the perfect game for you! <br>With many hours of content and dozens of features to enhance your clicking  experience, you will never get bored.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/a7027fee08631331a21db4e099bb4f72.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>The idle implementation of CoinBlock Clicker is unlike any other. Purchase many different idle games and let them collect coins for you.<br>Your idle coins will be delivered to your doorstep through our special tube network.<br>By upgrading the tubes, you can increase your idle income even further!<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/3800967dc626fad198cab77862547c5c.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>For completing simple tasks, you can get rewards and collect in game currencies.<br>There is even a daily quest that resets every 24 hours and is worth much more than those normal quests.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/4b495e6dee4a74f0fee5972a0c46e22a.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>Become stronger and more powerful by unlocking the items in the special item shop.<br>Items are very important when you want to make those numbers grow rapidly. <br>Collecting items will trigger a small event that boosts your income for a short time or even clicks for you!<br>But the best part is that you can even upgrade your items! That will increase their strength even further.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101730/extras/a55ee5ddd68d7d921bb7fd795230ee7f.avif?t=1716741625\" /></div><br><br>After progressing to a specific point, you will notice that you can unlock a prestige world. <br>By doing so, you will prestige your current progress, and you will have to start all over again with nothing.<br>But it's worth it, all coins have an increased value that grows with each unlocked prestige world. <br>You also unlock new coins, minigames and tubes after each prestige. <br>That means for every prestige you unlock, there is more content for you to explore!",
    "short_description": "CoinBlock Clicker is an idle clicker with a unique way of merging idle and clicker fun into one game! You simply click thousands of times on the coinblock and make those coins fly all over your screen!",
